cause when Black people reduce and end oppression for themselves, it ends and is reduced for everyone else. Even for poor White men.","media":null,"username":"dropoutnation","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":423,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":14.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126653810439593984","date":1557450175000,"rawContent":"Also, a reminder for all of us, especially those who want to deny opportunities for our children. #edreform #edequality #BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"dropoutnation","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":424,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":15.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1126922421389471745","date":1557514217000,"rawContent":"A major reason why so cops and other White people oppose #BlackLivesMatter is because it involves middle class and intellectually\/activism-talented Black people like @deray and @LamontLilly. That is galling to those poor and 'blue collar' White guys. It really is.","media":null,"username":"dropoutnation","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":425,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":16.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1131159112400744448","date":1558524322000,"rawContent":"Of course, civil rights and #BlackLivesMatter activists are dividing the nation. Because cops and others within criminal procedure systems stand to lose their jobs if the activists are successful. Also, can't arrest and condemn Black people anymore.","media":null,"username":"dropoutnation","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":17.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":426,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":17.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1135549995824943105","date":1559571191000,"rawContent":"It should be. @WFFMarc should get Walton to fund this effort. #edreform #BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"dropoutnation","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":427,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":6.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1136060703029321729","date":1559692953000,"rawContent":"A lot of Black kids are also scolded, especially by other Black people, for being children. Because so many of us were forced to act older and more mature than we were as children.\n\nThe intergenerational damage is beyond measure. #edreform #BlackLivesMatter","media":null,"username":"dropoutnation","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":428,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":14,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":7.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1136062436178632706","date":1559693366000,"rawContent":"Black people who should want to nurture out children and let them be kids for a little while longer instead beat up on those very children.\n\nIt isn't necessarily out